# Copy to .env.local (gitignored).
# Supabase project reused from fw-flextudy's account — project ref
# kzuvsgxqanawydghfqqp ("srcc"), a separate, genuinely-idle Supabase Cloud
# project (status: paused), NOT flextudy's live api.flextudy.in gateway.
#
# CORRECTION (2026-10-11): an earlier pass wired up tmjxmeygagcdvaieabjt,
# believing it was flextudy's idle *original* Cloud project. It is not —
# that hostname doesn't resolve (the Cloud project behind that ref is gone),
# and the anon key used was byte-for-byte flextudy's LIVE production
# EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY from apps/*/.env.local (api.flextudy.in,
# their real self-hosted gateway). That was a mistake — never use that key.
# kzuvsgxqanawydghfqqp is confirmed separate (different org project list
# entry, status INACTIVE) and isolated from flextudy's production traffic.
# Tables are still drift_-prefixed as a second line of defense.
#
# To activate: an admin unpauses the project at
# https://supabase.com/dashboard/project/kzuvsgxqanawydghfqqp, then run
# `npx supabase projects api-keys --project-ref kzuvsgxqanawydghfqqp`
# and paste the anon key below.
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

EXPO_PUBLIC_JIOSAAVN_BASE_URL=https://www.jiosaavn.com/api.php?__call=
